WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.681
Choosing your first gaming PC is easier when you begin with what you actually plan to do.

00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:24.000
The Budget tier is designed for students and first-time buyers who want everyday schoolwork and comfortable entry-level gaming. It is a practical choice for lighter games and standard 1080p monitors.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:37.276
The Esports tier focuses on fast, competitive games. These systems prioritize smooth frame rates and responsive performance, making them a good match for high-refresh 1080p monitors.

00:00:37.276 --> 00:00:55.149
The High-Performance tier is for demanding games, higher resolutions, stronger visual settings, and features such as ray tracing. Choose this tier for 1440p or 4K displays, graphically intensive titles, or more room for future upgrades.

00:00:55.149 --> 00:01:08.936
The Creator tier balances gaming with streaming, editing, 3D work, programming, and other production tasks. These systems often emphasize more memory, storage, multi-core performance, and media encoding.

00:01:08.936 --> 00:01:18.638
Use the CustomCore catalogue comparison, guided builder, and consultation request to narrow the choice.

00:01:18.638 --> 00:01:28.340
The best system is not always the most expensive one. It is the system that fits your real workload and budget without unnecessary upgrades.
